  "description": "Micargi Tandem Sport\nBuilt for two, the Micargi Tandem Sport brings the fun of cycling back to riding with a partner, friend, or family member. This dual-seat mountain-style tandem features a durable steel frame finished in a bold red, paired with wide 26\" knobby tires that handle pavement, trails, and everything in between with confidence.\nBoth riders get their own contoured saddle, adjustable seat post, and handlebar setup, with the rear rider enjoying independent hand controls for a true shared riding experience. The bike is equipped with a multi-speed drivetrain and dual crank system, allowing both riders to pedal in sync while covering more ground with less effort. Front and rear hand brakes provide reliable stopping power for the added weight and momentum of two riders.\nWhether you're cruising the boardwalk, exploring bike paths, or looking for a fun way to ride together, the Tandem Sport is designed to make every ride a shared adventure. Its sturdy construction and classic tandem geometry make it a great fit for casual riders and cycling enthusiasts alike.",
